{
  "name": "paged",
  "integration": "palo-alto-device-security",
  "description": "Two-page walk over the vulnerability index. Page 1 returns a full pagelength of 100 findings, so the paginator must issue a second call carrying offset=100; page 2 returns a short page and ends the walk. One device also appears in the inventory, proving the index is consumed by the device pass rather than double-reported. no_mac_in_id is skipped because IoT Security deviceid is the device MAC, which is why the script sets no-id-match no-id-break.",
